[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4944.229, "timestamp": "01:22:24", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4956.95, "timestamp": "01:22:36", "text": "我為什麼喜歡這樣讀？錯了。在海裡區分oya和oa，已經1個小時了，呃，完成了，詞彙Okusa，某人的妻子。嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4966.07, "timestamp": "01:22:46", "text": "走走，丈夫。等等，是丈夫。走"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4971.99, "timestamp": "01:22:51", "text": "。我以為是怪物。呃，你說什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4974.87, "timestamp": "01:22:54", "text": "等等。日語"}]